  "content": "\n\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>One Lucky Block (OLB) 是一款受其他空島與 OneBlock 整合包啟發的改版 OneBlock 整合包。</strong></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>本整合包將 OneBlock 與幸運方塊世界的體驗結合，打造獨一無二的空島玩法！此外，還包含數十款有趣的模組供您實驗探索，以及五個不同的維度等待遊歷。</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>當你首次出生在這個世界時，會站在草方塊上。距離幾格遠的地方會有一個幸運方塊。這兩個方塊都會無限再生。最終，你可以收集足夠的資源來建立基地，並前往其他並非無盡虛空的維度探索。不過請小心，因為每次破壞這個無限方塊時，都有機率刷出危險事物。</p>\n<p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1032/926/screenshot-2024-12-04-115913.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"755\" height=\"422\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>本整合包提供三種世界類型可供選擇：</p>\n<p>空世界（Empty World）－ 在普通的 OneBlock 出生，距離幾格遠處飄浮著一個幸運方塊。</p>\n<p>新手島（Starter Island）－ 同樣會出生在一個小型的新手島上，島上會提供說明與指引，告訴你後續該做些什麼。</p>\n<p>單一幸運方塊（One Lucky Block）－ 僅有一個幸運方塊可供出生，試著生存下去吧。</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>模組列表（v.1.2）：</p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/natures-compass\" rel=\"nofollow\">自然羅盤（by Chaosyr）</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/resourceful-config\" rel=\"nofollow\">Resourceful Config（by ThatGravyBoat）</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/angel-block-renewed\" rel=\"nofollow\">天使方塊重製版（by LaidBackSloth）</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/replanting-crops\" rel=\"nofollow\">作物自動復耕（by Serilum）</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/modernfix\" rel=\"nofollow\">ModernFix（by embeddedt）</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/forgottenrecipes\" rel=\"nofollow\">遺忘配方 - 幽匿感測器、哭泣黑曜石、皮革與細雪配方（by Affehund）</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/crops-love-rain\" rel=\"nofollow\">作物喜雨（by CoalTheBurnRock）</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/the-twilight-forest\" rel=\"nofollow\">暮色森林（by Benimatic）</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/voidtotem-fabric\" rel=\"nofollow\">虛空圖騰（Fabric 版）（by Affehund）</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/forge-config-api-port-fabric\" rel=\"nofollow\">Forge Config API Port（Fabric 移植版）（by Fuzs）</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/botany-pots-tiers\" rel=\"nofollow\">植物盆栽階級（by Ultramegaaa）</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/dark-utilities\" rel=\"nofollow\">暗黑工具包（by DarkhaxDev）</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/not-enough-animations\" rel=\"nofollow\">Not Enough Animations（by tr7zw）</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/runelic\" rel=\"nofollow\">符文時代（by DarkhaxDev）</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/justabaguette\" rel=\"nofollow\">只是一條法棍麵包（by purejosh）</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/heaven-dimension-mod\" rel=\"nofollow\">天堂維度模組（by Andragon11）</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/irisshaders\" rel=\"nofollow\">Iris 光影（by coderbot）</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/moogs-end-structures\" rel=\"nofollow\">MES - Moog 的終界結構（by finndog_123）</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/fast-furnace-for-fabric\" rel=\"nofollow\">快速熔爐（Fabric 版）（by tfarecnim）</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/indium\" rel=\"nofollow\">Indium（by comp500）</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/netherite-anvil-mod\" rel=\"nofollow\">下界合金砧模組（by Vasferd）</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/iceberg-fabric\" rel=\"nofollow\">冰山 [Fabric 版]（by Grend_G）</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/badpackets\" rel=\"nofollow\">bad packets（by badasintended）</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/creeper-overhaul\" rel=\"nofollow\">苦力怕重製（by joosh_7889）</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/supplementaries\" rel=\"nofollow\">補充包（by MehVahdJukaar）</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/puzzles-lib\" rel=\"nofollow\">謎題庫 [Forge &amp; Fabric]（by Fuzs）</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/immediatelyfast\" rel=\"nofollow\">ImmediatelyFast（by RaphiMC）</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/gravestones\" rel=\"nofollow\">墓碑（by geometrically_）</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/custom-window-title\" rel=\"nofollow\">自訂視窗標題（by chylex）</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/more-vanilla-shields\" rel=\"nofollow\">更多原版盾牌！（Fabric/Forge/NeoForge）（by Rajhab）</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/smaller-nether-portals\" rel=\"nofollow\">縮小地獄傳送門（by Serilum）</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/supermartijn642s-core-lib\" rel=\"nofollow\">SuperMartijn642 核心函式庫（by SuperMartijn642）</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/jei\" rel=\"nofollow\">物品查看器（JEI）（by mezz）</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/shaders/makeup-ultra-fast-shader\" rel=\"nofollow\">MakeUp - 極速光影（by XavierFST）</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/melody\" rel=\"nofollow\">Melody（by Keksuccino）</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/fabric-api\" rel=\"nofollow\">Fabric API（by modmuss50）</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/eden-ring\" rel=\"nofollow\">伊甸園之戒（by paulevs）</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/impaled\" rel=\"nofollow\">貫穿 🔱（by doctor4t）</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/botany-pots\" rel=\"nofollow\">植物盆栽（by DarkhaxDev）</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/disenchanter\" rel=\"nofollow\">附魔解除器（by gliscowo）</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/xaeros-minimap\" rel=\"nofollow\">Xaero 小地圖（by xaero96）</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/straw-golem-reborn\" rel=\"nofollow\">稻草人偶重生版（by CommodoreThrawn）</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/toms-storage-fabric\" rel=\"nofollow\">Tom 的簡易儲存模組（Fabric 版）（by tom54541）</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/vanilla-degus\" rel=\"nofollow\">原版蜜袋鼯（by minet_muette）</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/betterend\" rel=\"nofollow\">BetterEnd（by Quiqueck）</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/bookshelf\" rel=\"nofollow\">Bookshelf（by DarkhaxDev）</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/bclib\" rel=\"nofollow\">BCLib（by Quiqueck）</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/falling-tree\" rel=\"nofollow\">砍樹模組（by rakambda）</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/cloth-config\" rel=\"nofollow\">Cloth 設定檔 API（Fabric/Forge/NeoForge）（by shedaniel）</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/warp-portals-portal-teleportation\" rel=\"nofollow\">傳送門躍遷 ─ 傳送門瞬移（by gabriel_pinheiro）</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/xaeros-world-map\" rel=\"nofollow\">Xaero 世界地圖（by xaero96）</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/lucky-block\" rel=\"nofollow\">幸運方塊（by player_in_distress）</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/disable-enderman-picking-up-blocks\" rel=\"nofollow\">禁止末影人拾取方塊（by Rain_G）</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/selene\" rel=\"nofollow\">月光函式庫（by MehVahdJukaar）</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/iron-chests-for-fabric\" rel=\"nofollow\">鐵箱模組（Fabric 版）（by cyberanner）</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/energized-power\" rel=\"nofollow\">能量動力（by JDDev0）</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/sodium\" rel=\"nofollow\">Sodium（by JellySquid）</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/armorpoints\" rel=\"nofollow\">護甲值 ++（by CheosTwitch）</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/friends-and-foes\" rel=\"nofollow\">朋友與敵人（Fabric/Quilt）（銅傀儡、瞪羚、螃蟹、牛花、冰法師、惡作劇者、硬岩傀儡、野火、幻術師）（by Faboslav）</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/geckolib\" rel=\"nofollow\">GeckoLib（by Gecko）</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/haybale\" rel=\"nofollow\">乾草捆模組（by CommodoreThrawn）</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/pig-pen-cipher\" rel=\"nofollow\">豬欄密碼（by DarkhaxDev）</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/enchantment-descriptions\" rel=\"nofollow\">附魔說明（by DarkhaxDev）</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/fancymenu\" rel=\"nofollow\">華麗選單（by Keksuccino）</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/pick-your-poison\" rel=\"nofollow\">選擇你的毒藥 🐸（by doctor4t）</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/clumps\" rel=\"nofollow\">掉落物分組（by Jaredlll08）</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/prism-fabric\" rel=\"nofollow\">棱鏡 [Fabric 版]（by Grend_G）</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/trade-cycling\" rel=\"nofollow\">交易輪換（by henkelmax）</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/mouse-tweaks\" rel=\"nofollow\">滑鼠微調（by YaLTeR）</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/wthit\" rel=\"nofollow\">WTHIT（by badasintended）</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/openblocks-elevator-fabric\" rel=\"nofollow\">OpenBlocks 電梯（Fabric 版）（by farruchoo）</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/just-enough-professions-jep\" rel=\"nofollow\">職業查看器（JEP）（by Mrbysco）</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/konkrete-fabric\" rel=\"nofollow\">Konkrete [Fabric 版]（by Keksuccino）</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/collective\" rel=\"nofollow\">集合物件（by Serilum）</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/new-nether-chest\" rel=\"nofollow\">地獄儲物箱 [Forge &amp; Fabric]（by Fuzs）</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/better-tridents\" rel=\"nofollow\">更好的三叉戟 [Forge &amp; Fabric]（by Fuzs）</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/better-end-cities-vanilla\" rel=\"nofollow\">原版風格更好終界城（by TheArchitects777）</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/betternether\" rel=\"nofollow\">BetterNether（by Quiqueck）</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/anvil-restoration\" rel=\"nofollow\">鐵砧修復（by Serilum）</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/croptopia\" rel=\"nofollow\">農作物大世界（by thethonk）</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/appleskin\" rel=\"nofollow\">蘋果皮膚（by squeek502）</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/portable-mobs\" rel=\"nofollow\">可攜式生物（by Dremoline）</a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>本處使用的 OneBlock 程式碼作者：<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/worlds/oneblock-reborn\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/worlds/oneblock-reborn</a></p>\n<p>本處使用的 Lucky OneBlock 作者：<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/worlds/lucky-oneblock\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/worlds/lucky-oneblock</a></p>\n<p>原始 OneBlock 世界的完整版權與貢獻歸 IJAMinecraft 所有。</p>\